### 3. Эталонная реализация

#### DTO с валидацией
```java
public record LoanApplicationRequest(
    @NotBlank(message = "Phone number is mandatory")
    @Pattern(regexp = "^\\+7[0-9]{10}$", message = "Phone must match +7XXXXXXXXXX")
    String clientPhone,

    @NotNull(message = "Requested amount is mandatory")
    @DecimalMin(value = "10000.00", message = "Min amount is 10 000")
    @DecimalMax(value = "5000000.00", message = "Max amount is 5 000 000")
    BigDecimal requestedAmount,

    @NotNull(message = "Term is mandatory")
    @Min(value = 3, message = "Min term is 3 months")
    @Max(value = 60, message = "Max term is 60 months")
    Integer termMonths
) {}
```

#### Контроллер
```java
@RestController
@RequestMapping("/api/v1/applications")
@RequiredArgsConstructor
public class LoanApplicationController {

    private final LoanApplicationService service;

    @PostMapping
    public ResponseEntity<ApplicationResponse> create(@Valid @RequestBody LoanApplicationRequest request) {
        ApplicationResponse response = service.createApplication(request);
        return ResponseEntity.status(HttpStatus.CREATED).body(response);
    }
}
```

#### Unit-тест сервиса с ArgumentCaptor и AssertJ
```java
@ExtendWith(MockitoExtension.class)
class LoanApplicationServiceTest {

    @Mock
    private LoanApplicationRepository repository;
    @Mock
    private ScoringServiceClient scoringClient;

    @InjectMocks
    private LoanApplicationService service;

    @Captor
    private ArgumentCaptor<LoanApplication> applicationCaptor;

    @Test
    @DisplayName("Успешное создание заявки: верификация сохранения в репозиторий")
    void shouldCreateApplicationSuccessfully() {
        // Given
        var request = new LoanApplicationRequest("+79991234567", new BigDecimal("150000.00"), 12);
        when(scoringClient.isEligible(anyString())).thenReturn(true);

        // When
        ApplicationResponse response = service.createApplication(request);

        // Then
        verify(repository, times(1)).save(applicationCaptor.capture());
        LoanApplication savedEntity = applicationCaptor.getValue();

        org.assertj.core.api.Assertions.assertThat(savedEntity)
            .isNotNull()
            .extracting(
                LoanApplication::getClientPhone,
                LoanApplication::getAmount,
                LoanApplication::getStatus
            )
            .containsExactly("+79991234567", new BigDecimal("150000.00"), ApplicationStatus.APPROVED);

        org.assertj.core.api.Assertions.assertThat(response.applicationId()).isNotNull();
    }
}
```

